CRUD
create(Insert) :-
1) insertOne, 2)insertMany

ex:- db.user.insertOne({"name":"Vishwajit","skill":"MERNSTACK"})
     db.user.insertOne([{"name":"Vishwajit","skill":"MERNSTACK"},{"name":"Kedar","skill":"Python"}])

Read operation :-
1) find, 2) findOne
Ex:- db.user.findOne({"role":"Developer"}) It returns first found role = Developer

Ex:- db.user.find({"role":"Developer"}) It returns all found role = Developer

Ex:- db.user.find({"role":"Developer"},{name:1,email:1,_id:0})    :1 means want only that perticular field data :0 dont want

Delete 
1) deleteOne, 2) deleteMany

Ex:- db.user.deleteOne({"role":"Developer"})  delete only one on first found
Ex:- db.user.deleteMany({"role":"Developer"})  delete all having role developer


